OL,3,GNEWSAFears over rural GP surgery's
OL,4,Amonth-long closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients of a GP practice in rural
OL,7,FNorth Yorkshire have expressed concern
OL,8,Ffollowing an announcement it would be
OL,9,Fclosed for a whole month "due to
OL,10,Funforeseen circumstances".
OL,12,FA notice on the Church Lane Surgery
OL,13,Fwebsite said its Helperby branch would
OL,14,Fbe shut throughout September, adding
OL,15,Fthat patients could still access
OL,16,Fservices at the practice's
OL,17,FBoroughbridge site which is just under
OL,18,Fsix miles (9 km) away.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
