OL,3,GNEWSAFears over rural GP surgery's
OL,4,Amonth-long closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident Jil Coles, who has a visual
OL,7,Fimpairment and uses a mobility aid,
OL,8,Fsaid "even a short-term disruption"
OL,9,Fcould pose "a big problem for those of
OL,10,Fus that cannot drive".
OL,12,FChurch Lane Surgery was approached by
OL,13,Fthe BBC about the temporary closure,
OL,14,Fbut declined to comment.
